{"aggregate":"item","aggregateId":"01KTQ25NYWW00QQ78M260TJBPA","at":"2026-06-09T20:46:19.613Z","by":"cli:unknown","contentHash":"sha256:76a126a37e5400d77a06498c5f4bc28189028978d659b6d0c4c00dc50bc787f4","id":"01KTQ25NYYVMN01F12B1VKEVKX","payload":{"body":"OpenERP becomes a Sentropic dev-app (managed lifecycle, like radar-immobilier) running as a pure OIDC Relying Party against the Sentropic IdP (@sentropic/auth-hono).\n\nUser decisions taken:\n- Stateful DB-backed sessions (option 1B)\n- Tenant model follows Sentropic (workspace at OauthClient level; tenantId is NOT a JWT claim)\n- rpID/passkey ceremonies live at the Sentropic IdP (auth.sent-tech.ca); OpenERP runs no WebAuthn server\n- OpenERP retains its own internal multi-tenancy (organizations + organization_members + organization_id session claim)\n\nScope of AUTH-39-A (subset of auth-hono, ~8 of 15 ports):\n- DELETE passkey-service.ts, webauthn.ts handler, identity-provider.ts issuer parts\n- ADD oidc-client.ts, openerp_session_port, openerp_user_port, cookie/token/account-policy ports\n- ADD migration 0034 openerp_sessions (with organization_id extension) + 0035 oidc_state (PKCE/nonce)\n- ADD handlers /auth/login, /auth/oauth/callback, /auth/logout, /auth/org-select\n- Env: add OAUTH_ISSUER_URL/CLIENT_ID/CLIENT_SECRET/REDIRECT_URI; retire OPENERP_WEBAUTHN_* + OPENERP_WEB_ORIGIN\n- jose downgrade ^6 -> ^5 (auth-hono peer dep)\n- Org-picker: JSON 409 {code:ORGANIZATION_SELECTION_REQUIRED, organizations:[]}\n- Hard guards: publicKey base64url decode, createRemoteJWKSet caching, state/nonce binding, PKCE S256\n\nAwaiting:\n- Opus peer-review (aadc37b621e0635e8) — adversarial fact-check of the plan\n- Sentropic-team residual: tenantId on the openerp OauthClient row (set vs null)\n- Sentropic-team action: register openerp OauthClient + k8s namespace + KUBE_CONFIG_DATA","kind":"feature","role":"workpackage","title":"AUTH-39-A: adopt @sentropic/auth-hono as OIDC RP (Sentropic dev-app lifecycle)","workspace":"openerp"},"prevHash":null,"prov":{"auth":"local-user","proposed":false,"transport":"cli"},"seq":1,"type":"item.created"}
